---
const {projectId='',sources=[],staff=false,revisionOf='',archive,canSubmit=true,canReadHistory=true}=Astro.props;
---
<section data-editorial-workspace data-project={projectId} data-staff={String(staff)} data-can-submit={String(canSubmit)} data-can-read-history={String(canReadHistory)} data-owner={Astro.locals.user?.id} data-revision-of={revisionOf}>

<p><strong>Private audience:</strong> the submitting creator and authorised editorial staff only. Neither community nor artists can see this conversation.</p>
{!staff&&canSubmit&&<><p>Only your selected saved version, chosen passage or reference preview is submitted. Later edits never change that snapshot. Another version needs an explicit new request.</p><form data-editorial-form method="post" action="/api/studio/editorial-local">
<label>Saved card, manuscript section or visual reference<select data-source required><option value="">Choose one saved source</option>{sources.map((s:any,i:number)=><option value={i}>{s.kind==='guidebook'?'Companion':s.kind==='image'?'Reference':'Card'}: {s.title} · {s.version}</option>)}</select></label>
<details data-source-reading hidden><summary>Read the saved version I selected</summary><div data-source-prose></div><img data-source-image hidden alt="Selected private working reference preview"/></details>
<label>The exact passage to submit <button type="button" data-help aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="editorial-selection-help" aria-label="Help with selected passage">?</button><textarea name="selected_text" rows="6" maxlength="50000"/></label><p id="editorial-selection-help" hidden>Copy only the passage you need from the saved version above. We do not copy it automatically. For an image, leave this empty or choose an exact passage from its note. This sends a working preview, not the original production file.</p>
<label>What would you like Leilia to focus on? <button type="button" data-help aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="editorial-question-help" aria-label="Help with editorial question">?</button><textarea name="question" required minlength="10" maxlength="6000" rows="4"/></label><div id="editorial-question-help" hidden><h4>Personal</h4><p>What feels most important to preserve in this piece? You need not disclose personal experiences.</p><h4>Practical</h4><p>Name the writing or visual decision you want help with and the response that would be useful. A focused question is easier to review than an entire project.</p></div>
<label>Constraints or decisions already made <button type="button" data-help aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="editorial-constraints-help" aria-label="Help with editorial constraints">?</button><textarea name="constraints" maxlength="4000" rows="3"/></label><p id="editorial-constraints-help" hidden>Record what should remain unchanged, intended readers or a relevant format limit. This is context, not a request to upload your whole project.</p>
<a href={`/studio/projects/${projectId}/`}>Cancel</a> <button type="button" data-editorial-review>Review private request</button><section data-editorial-preview hidden><h3>Private submission preview</h3><p>Audience: you and authorised editorial staff only.</p><p data-preview-title></p><div data-preview-text></div><img data-preview-image hidden alt="Image that will be included in the private snapshot"/><div data-preview-question></div><p data-preview-constraints></p><label class="editorial-check"><input name="reviewed" type="checkbox"/> I have reviewed this exact material and private audience.</label><button type="submit">Send for editorial input</button></section></form></>}
<p data-editorial-status role="status" aria-live="polite"></p><h2>{staff?'Editorial requests':'Your editorial requests'}</h2><p>“Received” means your private request was saved. It does not mean an email was delivered or a response has been promised. Each request is reviewed as it comes in.</p><p>Complete project ZIPs include saved owner-only editorial history. Imports preserve it as archived evidence, never as an active request. Manuscript/JSON downloads exclude this history.</p>{!staff&&<p><a href={`/studio/projects/${projectId}/exports/`}>Open project exports and private-history backup</a></p>}<div data-editorial-records></div>
<script type="application/json" data-editorial-archive set:html={JSON.stringify(archive??null).replaceAll('<','\\u003c')}/>
<script type="application/json" data-editorial-sources set:html={JSON.stringify(sources).replaceAll('<','\\u003c')}/>
</section>
<script>import '../../scripts/editorialWorkspace';</script>
<style>[data-editorial-workspace]{max-width:68rem}[data-editorial-workspace] label{display:block;margin:1rem 0;font-weight:500}[data-editorial-workspace] textarea,[data-editorial-workspace] select{display:block;width:100%;padding:.7rem;box-sizing:border-box;margin:.5rem 0;font:inherit;background:#fff;border:1px solid #9d9e94;border-radius:3px}[data-editorial-workspace] select{padding-right:2.5rem}[data-editorial-workspace] button,[data-editorial-workspace] :global([data-editorial-records] button){font:inherit;min-height:2.75rem;padding:.55rem .8rem;border:1px solid #7b826f;background:#faf8f2;color:#24332c;border-radius:3px;cursor:pointer}[data-editorial-workspace] button:disabled{background:#deded9;color:#4b5563;cursor:not-allowed}[data-editorial-workspace] [data-help]{border-radius:50%;padding:.1rem .3rem;min-height:1.8rem;min-width:1.8rem;margin-left:.4rem}[data-editorial-workspace] img,[data-editorial-workspace] :global([data-editorial-records] img){max-width:100%;max-height:24rem;object-fit:contain}[data-editorial-workspace] [hidden]{display:none!important}[data-editorial-preview]{padding:1rem;border:1px solid #b9c1b4;background:#e4eadf;margin-top:1rem}.editorial-check{display:flex!important;gap:.5rem;align-items:start}.editorial-check input{flex-shrink:0;margin-top:.3rem}[data-editorial-workspace] :global([data-editorial-records] article){padding:1.25rem 0;border-top:1px solid #c9c0ad}[data-editorial-workspace] :global([data-editorial-records] textarea){width:100%;padding:.7rem;box-sizing:border-box;font:inherit;min-height:7rem}[data-editorial-workspace] :global(p){line-height:1.7;overflow-wrap:anywhere}[data-editorial-workspace] :global(button:focus-visible),[data-editorial-workspace] :global(a:focus-visible),[data-editorial-workspace] summary:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #315e67;outline-offset:3px}
</style>
